	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'Bệ hạ Rance...'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s get right to it...'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh?'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'Your wife.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'Fururu?'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'Fururu...?'
	R
	'Mhm, good name.'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'This Fururu’s apparently a 16'
	R
	'year old cutie.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, definitely!'
	R
	'So cute I could look at her'
	R
	'forever.'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'Her voice is also beautiful and'
	R
	'clear... Gahahahaha!!'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t act embarrassed, it’s'
	R
	'scary. Also, you disgust me!'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'When I think of you fucking'
	R
	'that cutie with your giant'
	R
	'body every night... Disgusting.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'This is the Splendid Cutie and'
	R
	'the Beast crime.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'Hah?? What does that mean...?'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'When a giant has sex with a'
	R
	'cute girl, it’s a crime.'
	R
	'So I’ve declared.'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'Anyways, that’s your crime!'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'If that’s what it is, then I’m'
	R
	'safe.'
	R
	'Our relationship is platonic.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah??'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s not what you think it is.'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'I promised her. When Fururu'
	R
	'turns 20, that’s when we’ll'
	R
	'start doing that... Uh...'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahaha!!'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_02587:
	ZH 1:
	'Cordoba blushed over whatever'
	R
	'he was thinking about.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'You would promise that?'
	R
	'You’re a pretty dedicated guy.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course.'
	R
	'Fururu’s important to me.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'If you’re not careful, a'
	R
	'forceful guy could take her'
	R
	'from under your nose...'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'That won’t happen.'
	R
	'I trust Fururu.'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph...'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'So... Does that mean Fururu’s'
	R
	'a virgin?'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'Probably...'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'No, I believe that’s the case.'
	\L_02604:
	ZH 1:
	'No... It doesn’t matter either'
	R
	'way. Fururu would still be'
	R
	'important to me...'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_024df:
	ZH 1:
	'Aagh, stop it! Stop running on'
	R
	'about how you love her in front'
	R
	'of me! Grrrr... Go away!'
	\L_02604:
	\L_025f7:
	\L_0254f:
	ZH 1:
	'Then excuse me.'
	\L_02604:
